sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant API as Backend
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    B->>API: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    API->>DB: throttle check · BCrypt verify
    API->>DB: store SHA-256(refresh token)
    API-->>B: access token (JSON, kept in memory) + refresh cookie (HttpOnly)
    B->>API: GET /documents · Bearer access token
    API-->>B: 200
    Note over B,API: 15 minutes later
    B->>API: GET /documents · expired token
    API-->>B: 401 INVALID_TOKEN
    B->>API: POST /auth/refresh · cookie sent automatically
    API->>DB: lock token row · revoke it · store a new one
    API-->>B: new access token + new refresh cookie
    B->>API: retry GET /documents
    API-->>B: 200
    Note over B,DB: If an already-rotated token is presented again,<br/>every session of that user is revoked (theft detection).
